Say when the arbitration queue lock is taken

The waiting thread prints LA want and then nothing, not even the busy same= line,
so it may be blocked earlier than the service check: on the global queue lock
that the self-recursive acquire could have left held.
---
diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/IOService.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/IOService.cpp
index 6d7dd7e..45dbe0b 100644
--- a/iokit/Kernel/IOService.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/IOService.cpp
@@ -1620,6 +1620,7 @@ IOService::lockForArbitration( bool isSuccessRequired )
 
 	// lock global access
 	IOTakeLock( gArbitrationLockQueueLock );
+	printf("\nnio: LA q t=%p", current_thread());
 
 	// obtain an unused queue element
 	if (!queue_empty( &gArbitrationLockQueueFree )) {
